<title>FRANCE: Credit Foncier 1996 results table.</title>
<headline>Credit Foncier 1996 results table.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable profit    858  vs  loss  10,751</p>
<p>    Net banking income	 4,544  vs	   4.944</p>
<p>    Operating costs	    2,102  vs	   2,325</p>
